# DIT-OS syscall ABI

Before editing matching files, read `.agents/skills/syscall-abi/SKILL.md` and follow
it. Also apply `AGENTS.md` (definition of done, handoff, hard rules) and the
mandatory `.agents/skills/security-audit/SKILL.md` for every code change.
Content lives in the skill; this file only points to it.

Never forget:
- Numbers live only in userland/include/syscall.h and kernel/include/syscall/syscall_numbers.hpp; SYS_exit is 6.
- Validate every argument; single fetch of user data; zero structs before copy_to_user.
- New syscall: add test_ and test_sec_ probes to userland/bin/init.c.
